From: flange <flange@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] dts: rk3576-armsom-cm5: wifi_chip_type 改为 ap6275s

wireless-wlan 节点的 wifi_chip_type = "rtl8852bs" 是工程样机遗留
（CM5 早期原型曾用 Realtek RTL8852BS）。量产实物模组为 BW3752-50B1
（Iton，基于 Broadcom BCM43752，等价 AP6275S）。

且这棵 argon BSP 树 drivers/net/wireless/rockchip_wlan/ 仅含 rkwifi
(bcmdhd)、无 RTL8852BS 源码，原标识既无对应驱动也与实物不符。改为
ap6275s 与实物对齐，配合 bcmdhd（patch 0001）+ AP6275S 三件套固件
打通 WiFi/BT 链路。

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3576-armsom-cm5.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3576-armsom-cm5.dtsi
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3576-armsom-cm5.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3576-armsom-cm5.dtsi
@@ -48,7 +48,7 @@
 
 	wireless_wlan: wireless-wlan {
 		compatible = "wlan-platdata";
-		wifi_chip_type = "rtl8852bs";
+		wifi_chip_type = "ap6275s";
 		clocks = <&hym8563>; //如果使用hym8563，只能配置一个
 		clock-names = "ext_clock";
 		pinctrl-names = "default";
